#  AI Agent for SMBs

An AI-powered business intelligence and workflow automation platform that helps small businesses transform operational data into actionable insights.

Live Demo: https://ai-agent-smb.vercel.app

## Tech Stack

React • Vite • TailwindCSS • n8n • PostgreSQL • Supabase • OpenAI • Vercel

## Overview

AI Agent for SMBs is an end-to-end business intelligence and automation platform that combines AI-powered analytics, workflow automation, and modern web technologies to help small and medium-sized businesses make data-driven decisions.

The platform allows businesses to collect operational data, automatically process it through AI workflows, generate actionable insights, and visualize results through an interactive dashboard.

This project demonstrates full-stack development, workflow automation, cloud database integration, AI-powered analytics, and modern SaaS architecture.

